
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.Pow(Value: number, Exponent: number): number`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`float llPow(float Value, float Exponent);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  use ^ because Double precision; operator.</span></p>
      <p>  <p>Returns a float that is <b>base</b> raised to the power <b>exponent</b> (<b>base</b><b>exponent</b>)</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>Value / base</td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>Exponent / exponent</td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>math</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">5</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-pure">Side-Effect Free</span>
        <span class="attr-label bg-native">Native Coded</span>
        <span class="lua-section attr-label bg-deprecated">Lua Deprecated</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>Returns NaN when <b>base</b> is negative and <b>exponent</b> is not an integer (an imaginary result, `(**exponent** != ([integer](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer))**exponent**) &amp;&amp; (**base** &lt; 0.0)`).</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If <b>exponent</b> is a static integer and not a variable, llPow is dramatically slower than simple repeated multiplication, i.e. it&#39;s much faster to do `val = base*base*base` instead of `val = llPow(base, 3)`.</li>
    <li>Triggers a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Error/Math" target="_blank">Math Error</a> for imaginary results if not compiled in Mono.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function main()
    ll.OwnerSay("llPow(5, .5) (" .. tostring(ll.Pow(5, .5)) .. ") is equal to llSqrt(5) (" .. tostring(ll.Sqrt(5)) .. ").")
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default {
     state_entry() {
          llOwnerSay("llPow(5, .5) (" + (string)llPow(5, .5) + ") is equal to llSqrt(5) (" 
                      + (string)llSqrt(5) + ").");
     }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
